type: software
title: "AI-READI Survey Data Element Mapping Artifacts"
abstract: "Value-set mappings of AI-READI survey, vision care and cognitive assessment (MoCA) data elements to the OMOP Common Data Model, with SSSOM metadata, LinkML schema, AI-READI custom vocabularies, and scripts to reproduce the counts reported in the TVST 2026 manuscript."
